Error [jet.ComptimeNetUnavailable]: `core.net.tcp_connect()` is not available at comptime.
  --> tests/ui/impure_net_stub.jet:6:24
    |
  6 |         conn: #run net.tcp_connect("build.example.com:443")
    |                        ^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Only `core.net.fetch(url, sha256:)` is supported at compile time as a Tier-1 hermetic effect.
 Fix: Use `core.net.fetch(url, sha256: "…")` for content-hash-pinned downloads.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E3412
